src/rfpack.ts derives from RoadForge's core/rfpack.ts. The typed-array lifting,
producer/version stamps, cache identities, non-blocking persistence, and
byte-budgeted eviction design are adapted from its artifact codec and scene
cache. Application-specific producers, renderer integration, and native IPC
have been replaced with standalone interfaces and examples.

